ounding boxes\n    ├── AuditScorecard.js      # Discrepancy scorecard & click-to-edit verification table\n    ├── CaSlipModal.js         # Printable A4 CA Audit Certificate modal\n    └── ApiKeyModal.js         # Optional Gemini API key configuration modal\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 Key Features Delivered\n\n1. **2-Column Mobile-Friendly Dashboard**\n   - **Left Column:** Drag-and-drop container accepting `.jpg`, `.png`, `.webp`, `.pdf` files, plus a **\"Snap Photo of Parcha\"** button that activates mobile camera capture. Includes privacy badge: *\"Privacy secured: bank details masked, files deleted after audit\"*.\n   - **Right Column:** 1-click test cards for the 3 sample bills:\n     - 🟢 **Sample 1: Clean Bill** (*Sharma Wholesale Traders*) — `Math Verified`\n     - 🔴 **Sample 2: Math Error** (*Modern Electrical Supplies*) — `₹1,000 Overcharge` (20 LED bulbs @ ₹95 billed as ₹2,900 instead of ₹1,900)\n     - 🟡 **Sample 3: Missing GSTIN** (*Gupta Packaging Materials*) — `Review Needed` with blurred rate field\n2. **Strict *\"AI Reads, Code Calculates\"* Engine ([`auditEngine.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/auditEngine.js))**\n   - Deterministically calculates `sum_items = sum(qty * rate)`.\n   - Recomputes taxes and verified grand total (`sum_items + cgst + sgst + igst`).\n   - If `|calculated_total - total_declared| > ₹1.00`, triggers an overcharge/undercharge alert.\n3. **Interactive Split Review Screen ([`ReviewWorkspace.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/ReviewWorkspace.js))**\n   - **Desktop:** Side-by-side view with realistic Tax Invoice preview on the left and audit breakdown on the right.\n   - **Mobile:** 1-tap Segmented Toggle (`Original Bill` ↔ `Audit Report`) with a persistent bottom summary bar.\n   - **Interactive Bounding Boxes:** Red (math error), Amber (missing/unclear data), and Green (verified) overlays on the bill. Clicking any bounding box scrolls to and highlights that item in the scorecard.\n   - **Click-to-Edit:** Shop owners can click directly into any Quantity or Rate field to adjust numbers, and the engine recalculates totals and differences in real time.\n4. **Dispute & Compliance Outputs**\n   - **📋 1-Tap Copy Dispute Note:** Generates a polite, pre-formatted WhatsApp/SMS note in English + Hindi citing invoice number, line error, and difference to request a Credit Note (*जमा पर्चा*).\n   - **📑 Printable A4 CA Audit Slip:** Formatted for Chartered Accountants and tax consultants for Input Tax Credit (ITC) reconciliation.\n5. **Client-Side Privacy Shield ([`privacyMasker.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/privacyMasker.js))**\n   - Bank account numbers (e.g. `•••• •••• •••• 4821`), IFSC codes (`SBIN••••••`), and private phone numbers are masked before rendering or transmission.\n\n---\n\n### 🖥️ Testing the App\n1. Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) in your browser.\n2. Click **Sample 2: Math Error** to view the ₹1,000 overcharge and interactive red bounding box.\n3. Click into the rate input or quantity in the scorecard table to watch real-time recalculation.\n4. Click **\"Copy Dispute Note\"** to copy the ready-to-send WhatsApp message, or click **\"CA Audit Slip\"** to preview the printable certificate.","thinking":"Server task `task-65` is operational, and the user can now access the application via `localhost:3000` or the local `index.html` file. Suspecting a possible file protocol issue due to the use of a module script, I will verify if the file loads correctly when opened directly.\n\n\nThe application is accessible via `http://localhost:3000` because the Python server handles the HTTP protocol correctly, overcoming potential `file://` protocol limitations with module scripts. Now, it's essential to recommend the user set `/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it` as the active workspace because it was just created.\n\nAll requested features appear to